# Lucky Draw sync configuration (reference only — the demo app reads the
# constants directly in app/index.html; this file documents their shape).
# Create a project at https://supabase.com, then in app/index.html set:
#
#   var SB_URL = "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co";
#   var SB_ANON_KEY = "YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY";
#
# The anon key is a public client key (row-level security protects the data);
# never put a service_role key in client code.
# Expected tables: profiles, spaces, space_members, visits, visit_ratings.
